OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan to arrive in UK
OL,4,Atoday
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week, it was reported that the
OL,7,Fcouple would be relocating to the UK in
OL,8,FAugust. They will not return to
OL,9,Fofficial duties but will live in
OL,10,FBritain as non-working royals.
